  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "神秘医院八卦  (Tabloid Photos Outside the Hospital)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moments after vowing nobody may visit the hospital, Bu Xiaogu spots tabloid photos of a disguised Xin Huimei entering the exact hospital where Chun Yuqiao is staying. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "又是辛惠美的八卦，有完没完了呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "还是她和闻思默那点事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些狗仔也太没料了，去个医院也要拍。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "至于吗，还全副武装呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看看，跟闻思默约会也没见她这么低调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这不是老大的医院吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得事关重大，我得去看看老大！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是，刚才怎么说不去吗？什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这姑娘对老大真上心了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁？对老大？你多想啊你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你要是能看懂女人心思，早把我追上了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "买个同款水杯有用吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "又是辛惠美的八卦，有完没完了呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'More gossip about Xin Huimei—will it never end?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "还是她和闻思默那点事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still the same chatter about her and Wen Simo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这些狗仔也太没料了，去个医院也要拍。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These paparazzi have nothing better to shoot—filming a simple hospital visit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "至于吗，还全副武装呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was all that disguise really necessary, bundled up head to toe?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看看，跟闻思默约会也没见她这么低调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look—even when dining with Wen Simo she never dressed this low-key.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这不是老大的医院吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait—is that not our boss's hospital?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得事关重大，我得去看看老大！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think this is a matter of grave importance—I have to go check on the boss!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是，刚才怎么说不去吗？什么情况？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on—did she not just swear nobody was going? What is going on?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这姑娘对老大真上心了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That girl has truly lost her heart to our boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谁？对老大？你多想啊你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who? For the boss? You are overthinking things!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你要是能看懂女人心思，早把我追上了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you understood a woman's heart at all, you would have won me over long ago.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "买个同款水杯有用吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would buying a matching water mug help?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
